Subject: [PATCH 08/12] v1.6.1 [council-1]: docs and pins (A6, A8, B gap 5, C1,
 C3, C6)

run_state_schema.md documents the gate sentinel's gate_result and
verdict_state values; harness plans accept DECISIONS; schemas.md
documents needs_text_review; artifact_contract.md lists
OPERATOR_DECISIONS.md, req_id_remap.json and quality/upstream/;
phase6.md's A-17 sentence follows the parent-witness rule (hash pin
updated); TOOLKIT.md CLEANUP bullet uses the reproduced vocabulary;
template text for State P5 / Bug evidence / claims_rules / Phase 5
OPERATOR_DECISIONS.md is pinned by needle tests.
